WEBVTT

00:07:28.066 --> 00:07:33.070
to more than 1.6 billion people
living downstream.

00:07:33.094 --> 00:07:35.578
That's one in five humans.

00:07:37.149 --> 00:07:39.254
That's why the Hindu Kush
Himalaya mountains

00:07:39.278 --> 00:07:41.713
are also called
the "water towers of Asia."

00:07:43.815 --> 00:07:45.219
But when glaciers melt,

00:07:46.213 --> 00:07:47.830
when monsoons turn severe,

00:07:47.854 --> 00:07:50.608
those rivers will obviously flood,

00:07:51.432 --> 00:07:54.401
so there will be deluges
when water is not required

00:07:54.425 --> 00:07:57.156
and droughts will be very common,

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:59.123
when water is desperately required.

00:07:59.147 --> 00:08:04.942
In short, Asia's water tower
will be broken,